Player prefab placeholder

This file is a human-readable placeholder for Assets/Prefabs/Player.prefab.
It is NOT a valid Unity prefab. Please open the project in Unity and create a
Prefab at Assets/Prefabs/Player.prefab with the following components:

- SpriteRenderer (assign Assets/Art/Characters/alpinator_idle.png)
- Rigidbody2D (Body Type: Kinematic)
- BoxCollider2D (size to fit sprite)
- Child GameObject "Catcher" with BoxCollider2D (Is Trigger = true) and tag "PlayerCatcher"
- PlayerController (script at Assets/Scripts/PlayerController.cs)

After creating the prefab, drag it into the scene and position it at the bottom center.
